<%# A workspace's mark for the switcher: its uploaded logo when it has one,
    otherwise a coloured initial. The initial's hue is derived from the org id
    so a given workspace is always the same colour — which is what makes the
    chip scannable at a glance rather than just decorative.

    Locals:
      organisation  Organisation
%>
<% if organisation.logo.attached? %>
  <%= image_tag rails_blob_path(organisation.logo, only_path: true),
        alt: "", class: "bottom-bar-workspace-logo" %>
<% else %>
  <span class="bottom-bar-workspace-initial"
        style="background:hsl(<%= organisation.id * 47 % 360 %>,52%,42%);"
        aria-hidden="true"><%= organisation.name.to_s.strip.first.to_s.upcase %></span>
<% end %>
